{
  "name": "push-conflict-different-fields",
  "protocol": 1,
  "description": "A conflict names the row fields whose values differ between the commit and the server row (server 0.1.1), sorted, without the bookkeeping fields. It is information only: nothing is applied, and the client still settles with last-writer-wins. Same data gives an empty list; a delete against a live row differs in deletedAt.",
